    "title": "Good Bait BND 180F",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">The Good Bait BnD was developed with one goal in mind: allowing anglers to perform several lure presentations with a single lure. Its innovative design enables diving pencil action, bubble-producing popper effects and subsurface minnow swimming action without changing tackle.</p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Diving jerk action with wobbling dive movement.</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Short jerks creating strong bubble attraction.</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Long jerks producing a straight slalom action.</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Slow retrieve imitating a fleeing baitfish.</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">This versatility allows anglers to combine attraction, pursuit and feeding triggers during the same cast, making it highly effective on pressured or selective predators.</p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Length </span>180 mm</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Gr. 91</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Color YellowHead</p></li></ul>",
